    <string name="about_title">About Verimots</string>
    <string name="about_body">Offline first: the selected list (forms of 2 to 15 letters) checks a word and the challenge with no network.\n\nA connection is needed only for automatic definitions (Wiktionary) and sharing.\n\nVerimots is not affiliated with NASPA, Mattel or Hasbro.</string>
