    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">No ads. Local history stays on the device. Signed in with Google, checked and played words are also saved to your account so you can find them on the web and on the phone.\n\nIn anonymous mode only the percent (0 to 100) is sent for the public average. Optional competition: Google ID, name and photo for this week’s board. Definitions go through s.pfa87.cc to Wiktionary.</string>
